{"seq":2,"slug":"manifest-and-installability","title":"Manifest 与可安装性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/pwa-foundations/manifest-and-installability","wordCount":1739,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"manifest-与可安装性\">Manifest 与可安装性</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Web App Manifest 是一个 JSON 文件，让浏览器将网站视为可安装的应用——name、icons、theme_color、start_url、display 等字段决定安装后应用的表现形式。浏览器满足安装条件（有效 Manifest + Service Worker + HTTPS + 用户参与度）后会显示&quot;添加到主屏幕&quot;提示或地址栏安装按钮。本节详解 Manifest 字段、图标多尺寸要求、显示模式、作用域、协议处理器、快捷方式、分享目标、安装提示控制及安装体验优化。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>name</td>\n<td>应用全名</td>\n<td>&quot;My App&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>short_name</td>\n<td>应用短名</td>\n<td>&quot;App&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>icons</td>\n<td>多尺寸图标</td>\n<td>192/512 px PNG</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>start_url</td>\n<td>启动 URL</td>\n<td>&quot;/&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>display</td>\n<td>显示模式</td>\n<td>standalone</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>theme_color</td>\n<td>浏览器栏颜色</td>\n<td>&quot;#3b82f6&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>background_color</td>\n<td>启动画面背景色</td>\n<td>&quot;#ffffff&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>scope</td>\n<td>URL 作用域</td>\n<td>&quot;/&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>orientation</td>\n<td>屏幕方向</td>\n<td>&quot;portrait&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>shortcuts</td>\n<td>快捷操作</td>\n<td>选项数组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>share_target</td>\n<td>接收分享</td>\n<td>url + params</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"manifest-配置\">Manifest 配置</h2><p><strong>HTML 链接</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;link rel=&quot;manifest&quot; href=&quot;/manifest.json&quot; /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">link</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"manifest\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> href</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/manifest.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Manifest 示例</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;My Productivity App&quot;,&#10;  &quot;short_name&quot;: &quot;MyApp&quot;,&#10;  &quot;description&quot;: &quot;A productivity app&quot;,&#10;  &quot;start_url&quot;: &quot;/&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scope&quot;: &quot;/&quot;,&#10;  &quot;display&quot;: &quot;standalone&quot;,&#10;  &quot;orientation&quot;: &quot;portrait&quot;,&#10;  &quot;theme_color&quot;: &quot;#3b82f6&quot;,&#10;  &quot;background_color&quot;: &quot;#ffffff&quot;,&#10;  &quot;lang&quot;: &quot;en&quot;,&#10;  &quot;icons&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;src&quot;: &quot;/icons/icon-192.png&quot;,&#10;      &quot;sizes&quot;: &quot;192x192&quot;,&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;image/png&quot;,&#10;      &quot;purpose&quot;: &quot;any maskable&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;src&quot;: &quot;/icons/icon-512.png&quot;,&#10;      &quot;sizes&quot;: &quot;512x512&quot;,&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;image/png&quot;,&#10;      &quot;purpose&quot;: &quot;any maskable&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;shortcuts&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;New Task&quot;,&#10;      &quot;url&quot;: &quot;/new&quot;,&#10;      &quot;icons&quot;: [{ &quot;src&quot;: &quot;/icons/new-task.png&quot;, &quot;sizes&quot;: &quot;96x96&quot; }]&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"My Productivity App\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"short_name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"MyApp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A productivity app\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"start_url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scope\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"display\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"standalone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"orientation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"portrait\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"theme_color\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#3b82f6\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"background_color\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"#ffffff\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"lang\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"en\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"icons\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"src\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/icons/icon-192.png\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"sizes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"192x192\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"image/png\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"purpose\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"any maskable\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"src\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/icons/icon-512.png\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"sizes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"512x512\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"image/png\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"purpose\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"any maskable\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"shortcuts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"New Task\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/new\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"icons\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"src\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/icons/new-task.png\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sizes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"96x96\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"图标要求\">图标要求</h2><p><strong>必需尺寸</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>192x192（最低要求）。</li>\n<li>512x512（启动画面必需）。</li>\n<li>推荐提供多个尺寸：192、256、384、512。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>格式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PNG（通用支持）。</li>\n<li>SVG（仅 Chrome 支持）。</li>\n<li>WebP（支持有限）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>用途（purpose）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>any</code>：默认模式（浏览器按需填充）。</li>\n<li><code>maskable</code>：Android 自适应图标（安全区域裁剪）。</li>\n<li><code>monochrome</code>：Android 主题化图标。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>可遮罩图标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Android 会将图标裁剪为圆形或方圆形。</li>\n<li>需确保安全区域在中心 80%。</li>\n<li>可用 Maskable.app 工具生成。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[图标需求] --&gt; B[192x192 最低要求]&#10;    A --&gt; C[512x512 启动画面必需]&#10;    A --&gt; D[多尺寸为佳]&#10;    A --&gt; E[Android 需要 maskable]&#10;    E --&gt; F[安全区域中心 80%]&#10;    F --&gt; G[避免裁剪]\">graph TD\n    A[图标需求] --&gt; B[192x192 最低要求]\n    A --&gt; C[512x512 启动画面必需]\n    A --&gt; D[多尺寸为佳]\n    A --&gt; E[Android 需要 maskable]\n    E --&gt; F[安全区域中心 80%]\n    F --&gt; G[避免裁剪]</pre><h2 id=\"显示模式\">显示模式</h2><p><strong><code>fullscreen</code></strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>全屏，无浏览器界面。</li>\n<li>适合沉浸式场景（游戏）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><code>standalone</code></strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>外观类似原生应用。</li>\n<li>无浏览器界面但保留系统状态栏。</li>\n<li>推荐作为默认选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><code>minimal-ui</code></strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>保留部分浏览器界面。</li>\n<li>适合需要导航控件的场景。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><code>browser</code></strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>标准浏览器标签页。</li>\n<li>等同于不安装。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>实战建议</strong>：选择 <code>standalone</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主题色与背景色\">主题色与背景色</h2><p><strong><code>theme_color</code></strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>浏览器地址栏和状态栏颜色。</li>\n<li>应用切换器中的标识颜色。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><code>background_color</code></strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>启动画面背景色。</li>\n<li>CSS 加载前的初始渲染背景。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>选择建议</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>theme_color 匹配品牌色。</li>\n<li>background_color 匹配应用背景色（避免闪屏）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"启动-url\">启动 URL</h2><p><strong><code>start_url</code></strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>点击图标时打开的 URL。</li>\n<li>通常设为 &quot;/&quot;。</li>\n<li>可添加追踪参数：<code>/?source=pwa</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>用途</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>区分安装访问与浏览器访问。</li>\n<li>为已安装用户定制落地页。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"作用域\">作用域</h2><p><strong><code>scope</code></strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>属于&quot;应用内&quot;的 URL 前缀。</li>\n<li>超出作用域的链接会在浏览器中打开。</li>\n<li>通常设为 &quot;/&quot; 表示全站。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>子作用域示例</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>应用为某子模块：<code>scope: &quot;/app/&quot;</code>。</li>\n<li>仅 /app/* 在 PWA 内运行。</li>\n<li>/blog/ 在浏览器中打开。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"安装条件\">安装条件</h2><p><strong>Chrome / Edge 安装条件</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>HTTPS。</li>\n<li>Manifest 包含 name + 图标（192+）+ display standalone。</li>\n<li>Service Worker 已注册并有 fetch 处理器。</li>\n<li>用户参与度信号（访问时长等）。</li>\n<li>尚未安装。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>满足条件后浏览器会显示安装提示或图标</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>手动触发安装提示</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"let deferredPrompt;&#10;&#10;window.addEventListener(&#39;beforeinstallprompt&#39;, (e) =&gt; {&#10;  e.preventDefault();&#10;  deferredPrompt = e;&#10;  // 显示自定义安装按钮&#10;  showInstallButton();&#10;});&#10;&#10;installButton.addEventListener(&#39;click&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  deferredPrompt.prompt();&#10;  deferredPrompt.userChoice.then((result) =&gt; {&#10;    if (result.outcome === &#39;accepted&#39;) {&#10;      console.log(&#39;Installed&#39;);&#10;    }&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let deferredPrompt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>window.addEventListener('beforeinstallprompt', (e) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  e.preventDefault();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  deferredPrompt = e;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 显示自定义安装按钮</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  showInstallButton();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>installButton.addEventListener('click', () => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  deferredPrompt.prompt();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  deferredPrompt.userChoice.then((result) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (result.outcome === 'accepted') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      console.log('Installed');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ios-添加到主屏\">iOS 添加到主屏</h2><p><strong>添加到主屏幕</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Safari 分享菜单 → &quot;添加到主屏幕&quot;。</li>\n<li>不会自动弹出提示（需用户手动操作）。</li>\n<li>使用 <code>&lt;meta&gt;</code> 标签适配 iOS：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"html\" data-code=\"&lt;meta name=&quot;apple-mobile-web-app-capable&quot; content=&quot;yes&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;meta name=&quot;apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style&quot; content=&quot;default&quot; /&gt;&#10;&lt;link rel=&quot;apple-touch-icon&quot; href=&quot;/icons/icon-192.png&quot; /&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"apple-mobile-web-app-capable\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"yes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">meta</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> content</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">link</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"apple-touch-icon\"</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> href</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/icons/icon-192.png\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> /></span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>iOS 限制</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>不读取 Manifest 中的图标。</li>\n<li>需用 <code>apple-touch-icon</code> 指定。</li>\n<li>推送通知需 16.4 以上版本。</li>\n<li>部分特性缺失。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"快捷方式\">快捷方式</h2><p><strong>长按应用图标弹出快捷操作</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;shortcuts&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;name&quot;: &quot;New Task&quot;,&#10;      &quot;short_name&quot;: &quot;New&quot;,&#10;      &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Create new task&quot;,&#10;      &quot;url&quot;: &quot;/new&quot;,&#10;      &quot;icons&quot;: [{ &quot;src&quot;: &quot;/new-icon.png&quot;, &quot;sizes&quot;: &quot;96x96&quot; }]&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"shortcuts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"New Task\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"short_name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"New\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Create new task\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/new\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"icons\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"src\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/new-icon.png\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"sizes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"96x96\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>平台支持</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Android、Windows 支持。</li>\n<li>iOS 不支持。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"分享目标\">分享目标</h2><p><strong>让 PWA 接收系统分享</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;share_target&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;action&quot;: &quot;/share&quot;,&#10;    &quot;method&quot;: &quot;POST&quot;,&#10;    &quot;params&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;title&quot;: &quot;title&quot;,&#10;      &quot;text&quot;: &quot;text&quot;,&#10;      &quot;url&quot;: &quot;url&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"share_target\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/share\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"method\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"POST\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"params\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"title\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"text\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"url\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>用户从其他应用分享内容时，PWA 可以接收处理</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>服务端</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>处理 POST <code>/share</code> 请求及其参数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"协议处理器\">协议处理器</h2><p><strong>让 PWA 处理自定义协议</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;protocol_handlers&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;protocol&quot;: &quot;web+myapp&quot;,&#10;      &quot;url&quot;: &quot;/handle?p=%s&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"protocol_handlers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"protocol\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"web+myapp\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"url\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/handle?p=%s\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>使用 web+myapp://something 即可打开 PWA</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"文件处理器\">文件处理器</h2><p><strong>让 PWA 注册为文件处理器</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;file_handlers&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;action&quot;: &quot;/open&quot;,&#10;      &quot;accept&quot;: { &quot;text/markdown&quot;: [&quot;.md&quot;] }&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"file_handlers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/open\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"accept\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"text/markdown\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".md\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>用户打开 .md 文件时可选择 PWA 处理</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"manifest-验证\">Manifest 验证</h2><p><strong>工具</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lighthouse：检查可安装性。</li>\n<li>Chrome DevTools Application 面板。</li>\n<li>pwabuilder.com：生成 Manifest + 审计。</li>\n<li>web.dev/measure。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>常见问题</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>缺少 192 / 512 图标。</li>\n<li>无 short_name。</li>\n<li>start_url 返回非 200。</li>\n<li>HTTPS 配置错误。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"安装体验设计\">安装体验设计</h2><p><strong>1. 不要立即弹出安装提示</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>令人厌烦。</li>\n<li>等用户有参与度后再提示。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 自定义安装界面</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>利用 beforeinstallprompt 事件。</li>\n<li>自定义按钮位置。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 延迟提示</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>让用户先探索内容。</li>\n<li>在合适的时机展示提示。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. 不要反复纠缠</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一次拒绝后不要立即再弹。</li>\n<li>30 天后再尝试。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 数据追踪</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>A/B 测试安装提示。</li>\n<li>衡量安装率。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"更新策略\">更新策略</h2><p><strong>Manifest 不会自动更新</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>浏览器会积极缓存 Manifest。</li>\n<li>修改 Manifest 后用户可能仍看到旧版，直到缓存过期。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>实战建议</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Manifest 变更应较少。</li>\n<li>重大变更后可能需要重新提示安装。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"反模式\">反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 没有 Manifest</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无法安装。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. 仅提供一个图标尺寸</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>浏览器回退显示效果差。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 主题色与内容冲突</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>视觉混乱。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. start_url 错误</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>安装后启动页面错误。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 没有 maskable 图标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Android 上显示异常（裁剪不当）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>6. 过于激进的安装提示</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用户安装率低且反感。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"多个-manifest\">多个 Manifest</h2><p><strong>同一域名下多个 PWA</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用作用域（scope）区分。</li>\n<li>App1 的 scope: <code>/app1/</code>。</li>\n<li>App2 的 scope: <code>/app2/</code>。</li>\n<li>各自拥有独立 Manifest。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"启动画面\">启动画面</h2><p><strong>浏览器自动生成</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用图标 + 名称 + background_color + theme_color。</li>\n<li>无法直接控制样式。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>iOS</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用特定的 <code>&lt;link&gt;</code> 标签指定启动画面图片。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>展示流程</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>初始加载 → 启动画面。</li>\n<li>DOM 就绪 → 显示应用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战建议\">实战建议</h2><p><strong>1. Lighthouse 满分</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>通过 PWA 审计。</li>\n<li>根据警告迭代 Manifest。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. Maskable 图标</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 maskable.app 工具生成。</li>\n<li>在 Android 上测试效果。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. 主题色与背景色匹配</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>避免刺眼的过渡。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>4. iOS 专属 meta 标签</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>确保 iOS 上的最佳体验。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>5. 测试安装流程</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Chrome 菜单 → 安装。</li>\n<li>验证 start_url、图标、主题色。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Web App Manifest 是 JSON 文件，让浏览器将网站视为可安装应用——包含 name、icons、start_url、display、theme、background 等字段。通过 HTML 中的 <code>&lt;link rel=&quot;manifest&quot;&gt;</code> 引入。图标要求 192/512 最低尺寸，purpose 支持 any/maskable（Android 安全区域 80%）/monochrome。显示模式包括 fullscreen（沉浸式）、standalone（推荐默认）、minimal-ui、browser。theme_color 控制浏览器栏和状态栏颜色，background_color 是启动画面背景。start_url 指定点击图标时的启动 URL（通常 &quot;/&quot;，可加追踪参数）。scope 限定应用内 URL 前缀。安装条件——HTTPS + 有效 Manifest + Service Worker + 用户参与度，满足后浏览器显示安装提示。可通过 beforeinstallprompt 事件自定义安装界面。iOS 需通过 Safari 分享菜单手动添加，需要 apple-touch-icon + meta 标签适配。快捷方式为长按图标弹出的快捷操作（Android / Windows 支持）。分享目标让 PWA 接收系统分享。协议处理器和文件处理器扩展 PWA 的系统集成能力。验证工具有 Lighthouse / DevTools / pwabuilder.com。安装体验设计不应立即弹出提示，应等用户参与后再展示、自定义界面、延迟提示、不反复纠缠、做好数据追踪。Manifest 是 PWA 的&quot;门面&quot;——配置正确让安装顺畅、体验接近原生；配置错误则安装失败或视觉效果差。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Manifest 与可安装性","id":"manifest-与可安装性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Manifest 配置","id":"manifest-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"图标要求","id":"图标要求"},{"level":2,"text":"显示模式","id":"显示模式"},{"level":2,"text":"主题色与背景色","id":"主题色与背景色"},{"level":2,"text":"启动 URL","id":"启动-url"},{"level":2,"text":"作用域","id":"作用域"},{"level":2,"text":"安装条件","id":"安装条件"},{"level":2,"text":"iOS 添加到主屏","id":"ios-添加到主屏"},{"level":2,"text":"快捷方式","id":"快捷方式"},{"level":2,"text":"分享目标","id":"分享目标"},{"level":2,"text":"协议处理器","id":"协议处理器"},{"level":2,"text":"文件处理器","id":"文件处理器"},{"level":2,"text":"Manifest 验证","id":"manifest-验证"},{"level":2,"text":"安装体验设计","id":"安装体验设计"},{"level":2,"text":"更新策略","id":"更新策略"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式","id":"反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"多个 Manifest","id":"多个-manifest"},{"level":2,"text":"启动画面","id":"启动画面"},{"level":2,"text":"实战建议","id":"实战建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"什么是 PWA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/pwa-foundations/what-is-pwa"},"next":{"title":"Service Worker 生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/pwa-foundations/service-worker-lifecycle"}}